{"3802850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Window Aquarista", "steam_appid": 3802850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Window Aquarista is a chill idle game about building and keeping your own aquariums. All while focusing on other tasks as the game sits on the bottom of your screen!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/79c15cf538560634c7e6625c9e1f7bbf.webp?t=1773869172\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/b73e7c829d4f056ef8bad54cfe477270.poster.avif?t=1773869172\" width=1170 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/b73e7c829d4f056ef8bad54cfe477270.webm?t=1773869172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visit the multiple fishing areas to unlock new species for your aquarium.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch over 60 differen't types of fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/af0a5278b27894bc860a3b885b80efe6.webp?t=1773869172\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/908b8f8a2b722a79685e4cc9ce277561.poster.avif?t=1773869172\" wid