ph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/70f2cef64df4698eaf60449db666f94b.webp?t=1773869172\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/5a4e9b4e237d0b34f72659bbd416dec3.poster.avif?t=1773869172\" width=512 height=269 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/5a4e9b4e237d0b34f72659bbd416dec3.webm?t=1773869172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep it clean!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Algae may take over an unwatched tank, but you have the tools to restore it to its full glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/9ced6c4d7b1d187e22ad06515f0ce8b9.webp?t=1773869172\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/eb9e0dbbd525503ce6d88cd2ea470b1d.poster.avif?t=1773869172\" width=512 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/eb9e0dbbd525503ce6d88cd2ea470b1d.webm?t=1773869172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a look at the growing catalogue of decorations and create your dream aquarium.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/11419cb9e647a030307c75963d955527.webp?t=1773869172\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game sits at the bottom of your screen, in a non-intrusive manner.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, watch, play, or do whatever you want while your fish live in the bottom of your screen!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi task without interferences.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something requires your full attention? Quickly set the game out of view, while still running!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/67c0a4f411aa5838ebac173c9b4e8aad.poster.avif?t=1773869172\" width=520 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/67c0a4f411aa5838ebac173c9b4e8aad.webm?t=1773869172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/67c0a4f411aa5838ebac173c9b4e8aad.mp4?t=1773869172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Window Aquarista is a chill idle game about building and keeping your own aquariums. All while focusing on other tasks as the game sits on the bottom of your screen!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802850/extras/79c15cf538560634c7e6625c9e1f7bbf.webp?t=1773869172\" w